# oc-sim scenario v1
# The TONE applet (journal/D-033): open the app menu, move the highlight down
# four times to TONE, launch it, then raise the note by three semitones (C5)
# and the level by five steps (1.5 V). CV1 adds half a volt: half an octave
# above C5, 739.99 Hz. The snapshot shows the four waveforms, one per output.
ticks 300
20  button up down
60  button down down
70  button up up
70  button down up
90  button down down
100 button down up
110 button down down
120 button down up
130 button down down
140 button down up
150 button down down
160 button down up
180 button left down
186 button left up
200 encoder 1 +3
210 encoder 2 +5
220 cv 1 500
